```

The error comes from spreading `ButtonProps`, which carries a `ref` typed for a button element, onto a Button rendered as an anchor. I'm fixing `LinkButton` with an explicit prop type (`variant`, `size`, `color`, `children`) and no spread of the full `ButtonProps`. `AppLink` has the same risk with `MuiLinkProps` spread onto `component={NextLink}`, so I'm giving it explicit props too.

